/*
 * This file implements the creation of semantic helper types and core
 * type-information structures used by the Ymir compiler. It provides the logic
 * required to:
 *
 *   - build map type-info(hash and comparison functions),
 *   - lazily load and cache core exception types,
 *   - instantiate class references and class pointers,
 *   - construct TypeInfo, TypeID, and FieldInfo types,
 *   - and load core traits such as Iterable and Hashable.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::type::create
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/type/create.yr
 * @Author(s):
